    <briefdescription>
<para>Plugin Dependency Graph Resolver. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides dependency graph building, circular dependency detection, and topological sorting for safe plugin load ordering.</para>
<para>Features:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Build dependency graph from plugin manifests</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Detect circular dependencies with full path reporting</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Compute safe load order via topological sorting</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Handle transitive dependencies</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Thread-Safety: All methods are thread-safe (stateless) </para>
    </detaileddescription>
